CITATION

If basinkit contributes to published work, please cite:

  Kaushik, P. (2026). basinkit: basin-scale acquisition of open Earth
  observation data. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22181933

and cite the datasets the run actually used. Basin.license_report() prints the
citation for every layer a run touched, and `basinkit cite --bibtex` prints the
BibTeX entry for the version installed.

